      "en_US": [
        "Allow me to introduce myself.\n",
        "I am Will.\r",
        "I have trained all around the world,\r",
        "making my Psychic-type Pokémon\n",
        "powerful.\r",
        "And, at last, I’ve been accepted into\n",
        "the Elite Four.\f",
        "I can only keep getting better!\f",
        "Losing is not an option!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0523_T10R0201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Even though I was defeated, I won’t\n",
        "change my course.\r",
        "I will continue battling until I stand\n",
        "above all Trainers!\r",
        "Now move on and experience\n",
        "the true ferocity of the Elite Four.\r"
      ]
    },
